Right after that happened,
Chirkoff, Jerkoff,

00:55:04.534 --> 00:55:05.802
whatever his name is,

00:55:05.802 --> 00:55:08.972
he appeared on all the national media.

00:55:10.073 --> 00:55:13.743
We have to get them
X-ray machines in there.

00:55:15.312 --> 00:55:18.381
Rapiscan, Rapidscan, somebody's scan,

00:55:20.417 --> 00:55:22.152
this name of the company.

00:55:22.152 --> 00:55:23.953
You know, they X-ray ya.

00:55:23.953 --> 00:55:25.121
They X-ray ya.

00:55:26.856 --> 00:55:28.291
Oh, son of a gun.

00:55:30.327 --> 00:55:31.161
Wow.

00:55:32.429 --> 00:55:36.199
Chirkoff is a consultant for that company

00:55:36.199 --> 00:55:38.868
