00:55:40.603 --> 00:55:42.806
(playful music)

00:55:42.806 --> 00:55:45.008
- [Voiceover] Okay,
let's get this straight.

00:55:45.008 --> 00:55:47.243
GMOs safe, raw milk unsafe,

00:55:49.079 --> 00:55:52.048
